# needs balloon.scm: the help balloon of a menu item. It must appear near
# the pointer and float over everything, not under the item it belongs to:
# there it covered the next item of the menu and was clipped to the menu's
# width, so walking down a menu replaced one item after another with an
# opaque box and the menu seemed to flicker.
wait 9000
window #2
click 409 12
wait 900
move 430 40
wait 1400
snapshot b0
move 430 72
wait 1400
snapshot b1
wait 400
